  "id": "slow-cooker-pumpkin-turkey-chili",
  "name": "Slow Cooker Pumpkin Turkey Chili",
  "subtitle": "A warmly spiced chili with pumpkin, beans, and ground turkey",
  "description": "Browned turkey simmers with pumpkin, tomatoes, beans, onion, and autumn spices for a hearty six-serving meal.",
